        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Faced with three chintzes. Top: two copperplate prints in sepia on natural cotton. Central print shows figures in rural settings; border print shows twisted ribbons and delicate floral sprays. Reverse natural cotton ground; pattern of hexagonal mesh. Border print badly rotted. Both faces stained and worn. A number of holes."@en ;
